            <h1>About the Project</h1>

            <p>The <strong>Periodic Table: Interactive 3D</strong> is an educational tool designed for students,
                researchers, and chemistry enthusiasts. Our goal is to provide a modern, interactive way to explore the
                building blocks of the universe.</p>
            <h2>Data Sources</h2>
            <p>Data used in this application is aggregated from reliable scientific sources including Wikipedia, IUPAC,
                and curated datasets by chemistry researchers. We strive for accuracy, but users should always consult
                primary scientific literature for critical research.</p>
            <h2>Developer</h2>
            <p>This project is maintained by the Periodic Table Team. We are passionate about making science education
                accessible and visually engaging.</p>

